<!doctype html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Iniciar sesión · Cupesí</title><style>body{margin:0;font:15px/1.5 Arial,sans-serif;background:#f1f0ed;color:#231a15}*{box-sizing:border-box}.auth{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(360px,46%) 1fr;min-height:100vh}.hero{padding:42px;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#180e09d9,#180e0966,#180e09eb),url('{{ asset('images/login/portada.jpeg') }}') center/cover;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.brand{font-size:25px;font-weight:bold}.eyebrow{display:inline-block;color:#ffc857;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:.14em;margin-bottom:14px}.hero-copy{margin-top:auto;max-width:440px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,44px);line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 14px}.hero p{color:#ffdcc2;max-width:38ch}.hero ul{list-style:none;padding:0;color:#fff;margin-top:24px}.hero li{margin:10px 0}.hero li::before{content:'✓';color:#ffc857;font-weight:bold;margin-right:10px}.panel{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:30px}.box{width:100%;max-width:430px}.badge{display:inline-flex;background:#e3f2e8;color:#2f7d4f;border-radius:99px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:.06em}.box h2{font-size:34px;margin:18px 0 4px}.sub{color:#6c6159;margin:0 0 26px}.f{margin:17px 0}label{display:block;color:#6c6159;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px}.input-wrap{position:relative}.input-wrap span{position:absolute;left:13px;top:12px;color:#6c6159}.input-wrap input{padding-left:38px}.input-wrap input.password{padding-right:48px}input{width:100%;min-height:48px;border:1px solid #e3ded6;border-radius:9px;padding:8px 12px;font:inherit;background:#fff}input:focus{outline:3px solid #cc4a0533;border-color:#cc4a05}.toggle{position:absolute;right:5px;top:5px;height:38px;width:38px;border:0;border-radius:7px;background:transparent;cursor:pointer}.toggle:hover{background:#fbf4ee}.btn{width:100%;min-height:50px;background:#cc4a05;border:0;border-radius:9px;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 10px 24px #cc4a0533}.btn:hover{background:#a63c03}.message{padding:11px 13px;border-radius:9px;background:#fdecea;color:#b42318;margin:12px 0}.message.ok{background:#e3f2e8;color:#2f7d4f}@media(max-width:800px){.auth{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{min-height:290px;padding:26px}.hero-copy{margin-top:auto}.hero h1{font-size:30px}.hero ul{display:none}.panel{padding:32px 20px 48px}}
</style></head><body><div class="auth"><aside class="hero"><div class="brand">✦ Cupesí</div><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">SISTEMA DE VENTAS E INVENTARIOS</span><h1>Tu negocio, organizado en un solo lugar.</h1><p>Administra tus ventas, stock y sucursales con seguridad por roles.</p><ul><li>Inventario actualizado por sucursal</li><li>Ventas rápidas y comprobantes imprimibles</li><li>Acceso protegido para tu equipo</li></ul></div></aside><main class="panel"><div class="box"><span class="badge">● ACCESO SEGURO</span><h2>Iniciar sesión</h2><p class="sub">Ingresa tus credenciales para continuar.</p><div class="message {{ session('success')?'ok':'' }}" style="display:{{ session('success')||$errors->any()?'block':'none' }}">{{ session('success') ?: $errors->first() }}</div><form method="POST" action="{{ route('login.store') }}">@csrf<div class="f"><label for="nombre_usuario">Nombre de usuario</label><div class="input-wrap"><span>◉</span><input id="nombre_usuario" name="nombre_usuario" value="{{ old('nombre_usuario') }}" autocomplete="username" required autofocus></div></div><div class="f"><label for="password">Contraseña</label><div class="input-wrap"><span>●</span><input class="password" id="password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required><button class="toggle" type="button" aria-label="Mostrar contraseña" onclick="togglePassword(this)">◉</button></div></div><button class="btn" type="submit">Ingresar al sistema →</button></form></div></main></div><script>function togglePassword(button){const input=document.getElementById('password');const visible=input.type==='text';input.type=visible?'password':'text';button.textContent=visible?'◉':'◉';button.setAttribute('aria-label',visible?'Mostrar contraseña':'Ocultar contraseña')}</script></body></html>
